{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29796","headline":"念远 · 李商隐","name":"念远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月淹秦甸，江湖动越吟。\n苍桐应露下，白阁自云深。\n皎皎非鸾扇，翘翘失凤簪。\n牀空鄂君被，杵冷女媭砧。\n北思惊沙雁，南情属海禽。\n关山已摇落，天地共登临。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}